'2026-04-11 16:31:36'),(72,'google_search_console','','seo','2026-04-11 16:31:36','2026-04-11 16:31:36'),(73,'social_facebook','https://www.facebook.com/ahtapot34','social','2026-04-19 09:17:26','2026-04-19 09:17:26'),(74,'seo_og_image','/uploads/branding/69e8df48955f8_Deck-Klips-Modelleri-.jpg','seo','2026-04-22 14:39:19','2026-04-22 14:46:32'),(75,'active_languages','tr,en,ar','general','2026-04-24 14:59:19','2026-04-24 14:59:19'),(76,'hero_title_en','Premium Deck Clips and Mounting Systems','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 18:57:01'),(77,'hero_subtitle_en','We offer the most durable, aesthetic, and reliable solutions for your deck projects. Our state-of-the-art products combine longevity with easy installation.','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(78,'about_title_en','About Us','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 15:53:39'),(79,'hero_button_text_en','View Products','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(80,'hero_button_link_en','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(81,'hero_image_1_en','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(82,'hero_image_2_en','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(83,'hero_image_3_en','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(84,'hero_video_url_en','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(85,'about_subtitle_en','Industry Leader in Deck Systems Since 2012','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(86,'about_text_1_en','DECK Klips started its journey in 2012 to produce innovative solutions for the deck industry. With our advanced manufacturing facility and expert team, we manufacture metal and premium plastic deck clips that meet global standards.','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(87,'about_text_2_en','Our vision is to provide maximum durability and aesthetic perfection in outdoor living spaces. We export to over 20 countries, ensuring customer satisfaction and uncompromised quality in every project we touch.','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(88,'about_button_text_en','Discover Our History','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(89,'about_image_1_en','','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(90,'about_image_2_en','','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(91,'about_image_3_en','','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(92,'about_image_4_en','','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(93,'seo_title_en','DECK CLIPS - Professional Decking and Installation Systems','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-25 11:17:29'),(94,'seo_description_en','DECK CLIPS is Turkey\'s leading manufacturer of deck clips, offering long-lasting, aesthetic, and durable solutions for outdoor flooring applications. Discover our hidden fastening systems, stainless steel clips, and UV-resistant plastic clip solutions.','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-25 11:17:29'),(95,'seo_keywords_en','deck clips, plastic deck clips, stainless steel deck clips, hidden fastening clips, wooden decking installation, WPC deck clips, deck fixing accessories, decking accessories','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-25 11:17:29'),(96,'google_analytics_en','','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(97,'google_search_console_en','','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(98,'seo_og_image_en','','seo','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 14:59:20'),(107,'hero_title_ar','مشابك الأسطح الفاخرة وأنظمة التثبيت','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(108,'hero_subtitle_ar','نقدم الحلول الأكثر متانة وجمالية وموثوقية لمشاريع الأسطح الخاصة بك. منتجاتنا المتطورة تجمع بين طول العمر وسهولة التركيب.','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(109,'about_title_ar','معلومات عنا','about','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(110,'hero_button_text_ar','عرض المنتجات','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2026-04-24 19:00:42'),(111,'hero_button_link_ar','','hero','2026-04-24 14:59:20','2